%% Source basis: course Lectures 1 and 3, Intel MCS-51 User's Manual [2]
flowchart TB
    CPU[8051 CPU\n8-bit datapath + PC + SP + DPTR]
    PM[Program memory\nแยก address space\n0000H–FFFFH logical range]
    DM[Data memory\nแยก address space\ninternal / external]
    IR[Internal data RAM\n00H–7FH in classic 8051]
    RB[Register banks\n00H–1FH\nR0–R7 x 4 banks]
    BA[Bit-addressable RAM\n20H–2FH\n128 individual bits]
    GP[General-purpose RAM\n30H–7FH]
    SFR[SFR space\n80H–FFH\nports timers serial interrupt control]
    XRAM[External data RAM\nup to 64K logical data address space]
    CPU -->|instruction fetch via PC| PM
    CPU -->|direct/indirect data access| DM
    DM --> IR
    IR --> RB
    IR --> BA
    IR --> GP
    DM --> SFR
    DM --> XRAM
